{"title":"博客重构——由DeepSeek接手","uid":"809c5cf2d5ed651977105ff0c693fef0","slug":"DeepSeek-Restructure","date":"2026-05-02T04:00:00.000Z","updated":"2026-05-02T08:23:26.479Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/DeepSeek-Restructure.json","keywords":null,"cover":"/img/photo-16.jpg","content":"<h2 id=\"新的开始\"><a href=\"#新的开始\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"新的开始\"></a>新的开始</h2><p>本博客基于 Hexo 7 + Aurora 2.5.3 主题构建，原作者 <a href=\"https://github.com/auroral-ui/hexo-theme-aurora\">Benny Guo（三钻）</a> 已停止维护约三年。即日起，博客的维护与二次开发由 <strong>DeepSeek（deepseek-v4-pro）</strong> 接手重构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"已完成\"><a href=\"#已完成\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"已完成\"></a>已完成</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>移除评论区</strong> — 全站评论区及侧边栏”最近评论”模块已关闭</li>\n<li><strong>移除原作者署名</strong> — 终端输出的原作者 credit 信息已清理</li>\n<li><strong>项目文档更新</strong> — 新增 <code>CLAUDE.md</code>，便于 AI 辅助开发时快速理解项目结构</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"方向\"><a href=\"#方向\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"方向\"></a>方向</h2><p>后续将逐步对主题进行轻量化改造，在保留 Hexo 静态生成能力的前提下，使前端更贴近现代 Vue 3 开发方式。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>与其临渊羡鱼，不如退而结网。</p></blockquote>\n","feature":true,"text":"新的开始本博客基于 Hexo 7 + Aurora 2.5.3 主题构建，原作者 Benny Guo（三钻） 已停止维护约三年。即日起，博客的维护与二次开发由 ...","permalink":"/post/DeepSeek-Restructure","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":304,"symbolsTime":"1 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"blog","slug":"blog","count":5,"path":"api/categories/blog.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"个人建站","slug":"个人建站","count":7,"path":"api/tags/个人建站.json"}],"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B\"><span class=\"toc-text\">新的开始</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E5%B7%B2%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90\"><span class=\"toc-text\">已完成</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E6%96%B9%E5%90%91\"><span class=\"toc-text\">方向</span></a></li></ol>","author":{"name":"LuiYang","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"https://pic.superbed.cc/item/675c6b0efa9f77b4dc5da666.jpg","link":"/","description":"<p>与其临渊羡鱼，不如退而结网</p>one should take practical steps achieve one's aim","socials":{"github":"https://github.com/LuiYang08","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","wechat":"","qq":"","weibo":"","zhihu":"","csdn":"","juejin":"","customs":{"bilibili":{"icon":"/svg/bilibili.svg